 "headline": "",
 "intro": "We gave influencers and fans the chance to summon Thor’s mighty thunder with an LED photo experience and recreate the iconic teaser poster for Thor: Love and Thunder",
 "introPieces": [
  {
   "type": "text2",
   "left": "<p>IHC conceptualized and built a 4D Lightning Mountain photo experience as a recreation of the epic teaser poster. To pull it off, we used in-world props, a 15-foot LED screen with original animations, and custom Snapchat filter technology that was activated by raising Thor's mighty weapons Mjölnir or Stormbreaker. The results? Yeilding the power of the Gods and a fantastic time for fans of all ages!</p>",
   "right": "<p>The experience was produced exclusively for Straw Hat Goofy’s influencer screening event ahead of opening weekend. IHC also helped curate the guest list for the screening to bring in an impactful audience.</p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "WATCH THE RECAP",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "video",
     "embed": "<div class=\"p-cs__video__el w-video w-embed\" style=\"padding-top:56.27659574468085%\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" class=\"embedly-embed\" height=\"529\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"//cdn.embedly.com/widgets/media.html?src=https%3A%2F%2Fplayer.vimeo.com%2Fvideo%2F774022650%3Fh%3Da8d09e84b5%26app_id%3D122963&amp;dntp=1&amp;display_name=Vimeo&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fplayer.vimeo.com%2Fvideo%2F774022650%3Fh%3Da8d09e84b5&amp;image=https%3A%2F%2Fi.vimeocdn.com%2Fvideo%2F1553121577-10356d3ca09f85f5598555b67679ba354ec57d57cf90db43d228f7378059284a-d_1280&amp;key=96f1f04c5f4143bcb0f2e68c87d65feb&amp;type=text%2Fhtml&amp;schema=vimeo\" title=\"Thor photobooth_v2\" width=\"940\"></iframe></div>"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "THE BUILD",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>IHC utilized partners Tommy B, Vandivision and ASOAE to bring a three-part photo experience for Thor fans to life! Using assets from the film to create original animation for the backdrop and the lighting, they were also made into a custom Snapchat filter developed exclusively for the booth.</p>",
     "right": "<p>Then, fans stepped up to hand sculpted and painted triple-stacked mountain peak build that transported them into the peaks of Asgard!</p>"
    },
