  {
   "title": "THE RESULTS",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Once fans stepped into the booth and raised their arm with their hammer of choice, the results were incredible, placing them inside the movie poster and putting the power of the God of Thunder in the palms of their hands. IHC also curated a large portion of the influencer attendees with guests such as Totally Enormous Extinct Dinosaurs, Gary Baseman, Gabby Maiden and Sam Richardson all participating.</p>"
    },
